    "name": "Judenki Kashite",
    "steam_appid": 3324650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/2f1248a2762355d4f1f88630d619ee36.avif?t=1754744496\" width=800 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Judenki Kashite&quot; is a game inspired by masterpieces of games, films, manga, and anime from the 1980s to the 2020s, created with deep respect and admiration for the great creators behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience hyper-speed noir action that pushes the limits of intensity, while enjoying a quietly unfolding story delicately woven within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move with WASD keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can talk with the E key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't pay respects by pressing F key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can shoot with the left mouse button, but unfortunately, there are no moon-dust, so portals won't open.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a single player game. So you don't have to stress about playing with 9 cheaters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no 'weapon skin' feature. So you don't have to spend $1000 to get a weapon skin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Judenki Kashite&quot; is currently in development. It will be completed at least before Half-Life 3 is released.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This description is written to the best of my ability, following the guideline of &quot;You can't release a game without sufficient description of its features and content.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ETC</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're planning to create an introduction or gameplay video for &quot;Judenki Kashite,&quot; please feel free to use the assets below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/18ac44855ce81d82d5eb48d7a9191787.avif?t=1754744496\" data-has-big width=800 height=398 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title Logo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/8ddaa15395af90cde49a7994d1018776.avif?t=1754744496\" data-has-big width=800 height=639 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otter (Basic Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/f51eb2ca0bab0beced1caa496c5aaed8.avif?t=1754744496\" width=800 height=1318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stray (Basic Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/125384b4f01b21e676bfebca5739fff9.avif?t=1754744496\" data-has-big width=800 height=639 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otter (Dark Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/7b3167cecf10b5643db96e7195c62a1c.avif?t=1754744496\" width=800 height=1318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stray (DayLight Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/9d334580dbc2fd036c86d9a3c33658f9.avif?t=1754744496\" width=800 height=1318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stray (Night Version)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/2f1248a2762355d4f1f88630d619ee36.avif?t=1754744496\" width=800 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Judenki Kashite&quot; is a game inspired by masterpieces of games, films, manga, and anime from the 1980s to the 2020s, created with deep respect and admiration for the great creators behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience hyper-speed noir action that pushes the limits of intensity, while enjoying a quietly unfolding story delicately woven within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move with WASD keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can talk with the E key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't pay respects by pressing F key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can shoot with the left mouse button, but unfortunately, there are no moon-dust, so portals won't open.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a single player game. So you don't have to stress about playing with 9 cheaters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no 'weapon skin' feature. So you don't have to spend $1000 to get a weapon skin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Judenki Kashite&quot; is currently in development. It will be completed at least before Half-Life 3 is released.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This description is written to the best of my ability, following the guideline of &quot;You can't release a game without sufficient description of its features and content.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ETC</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're planning to create an introduction or gameplay video for &quot;Judenki Kashite,&quot; please feel free to use the assets below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/18ac44855ce81d82d5eb48d7a9191787.avif?t=1754744496\" data-has-big width=800 height=398 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title Logo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/8ddaa15395af90cde49a7994d1018776.avif?t=1754744496\" data-has-big width=800 height=639 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otter (Basic Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/f51eb2ca0bab0beced1caa496c5aaed8.avif?t=1754744496\" width=800 height=1318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stray (Basic Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/125384b4f01b21e676bfebca5739fff9.avif?t=1754744496\" data-has-big width=800 height=639 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otter (Dark Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/7b3167cecf10b5643db96e7195c62a1c.avif?t=1754744496\" width=800 height=1318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stray (DayLight Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/9d334580dbc2fd036c86d9a3c33658f9.avif?t=1754744496\" width=800 height=1318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stray (Night Version)</p>",
